<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Patrick Industries.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Patrick Industries.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oppenheimer downgraded Patrick Industries Inc to market perform from buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Patrick Industries lost 1/8 to 14-7/8.</p>
</text>
